f. NonCommercial means not primarily intended for or directed towards commercial advantage or monetary compensation.
g. Share means to provide material to the public by any means or process that requires permission under the Licensed Rights, such as reproduction, public display, public performance, distribution, dissemination, communication, or importation.
h. ShareAlike means that if You Share Adapted Material You produce, You must license it under this Public License or a BY-NC-SA Compatible License.

